   "subject": "Re: help: composing javascript for conditionalPanel",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think I got it...<div><br></div><div>Joe answered it here: <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/shiny-discuss/S15Vp7P72eg/yNv_O-axrd8J\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!msg/shiny-discuss/S15Vp7P72eg/yNv_O-axrd8J&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407464964000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27TbMirEKKlHmK8pnpu9xU\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/shiny-discuss/S15Vp7P72eg/yNv_O-axrd8J</a></div><div><br></div><div>Because my output was not being displayed, the calculation was suspended.</div><div><br></div><div>A line like this within the shinyServer function does the trick.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">outputOptions</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">&quot;csv_import_ready&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"> suspendWhenHidden </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">)</span><br></div><div><br></div><div>This gist has been updated:  <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/ijlyttle/6230575\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/ijlyttle/6230575&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407464964000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36K6Oo22OCBXjyL6WCtXEY\">https://gist.github.com/ijlyttle/6230575</a></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Ian</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
