;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\"> suspendWhenHidden </span><span style=\"line-height:16px;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"line-height:16px;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\"> </span><span style=\"line-height:16px;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-weight:bold\">FALSE</span><span style=\"line-height:16px;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">)</span><br>\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>This gist has been updated:  <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/ijlyttle/6230575\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/ijlyttle/6230575&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407464967000&amp;usg=AOvVaw326-uYI9m0Ocsrt32RklJ_\">https://gist.github.<u></u>com/ijlyttle/6230575</a></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br>\r\n\r\n</div><div>Ian</div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
